1.0.5 (2026-11-14)
==================
- added use_admin config value: sites without the admin section; init asks for it and for the database
- renamed the rivena_migrations table to migrations and sql/app.sql to sql/admin.sql
- added rivena.getCookie(), getTheme() and setTheme(); setCookie() saves objects and arrays
- added the .spinner class
- added Controller.openDialog() and closeDialog() for a page's own dialog
- moved the dialogs' partials to partials/ and assets/js/admin to assets/js/common
- removed the Http class (use $request->wantsJson())
- changed the font to Open Sans
- thin scrollbars everywhere
- fixed the border color and style classes next to a width class
- fixed the sidebar's section menus on small screens

1.0.4 (2026-10-31)
==================
- added the content dialog: showDialog() shows a template of the page
- added width and height options to the dialogs; their contents scroll
- fixed the navbar's dropdowns showing above the dialogs

1.0.3 (2026-10-31)
==================
- added use_database config value: sites without a database
- minor css changes

1.0.2 (2026-10-29)
==================
- changed GeoIp db provider

1.0.1 (2026-10-28)
==================
- moved dist and package.json into assets, the npm package has its own readme

1.0.0 (2026-10-28)
==================
- initial release